Mat2Ppt
=======

Mat2Ppt is a MATLAB port of the python-pptx library.

This product includes material derived from python-pptx:

  python-pptx
  Copyright (c) 2013 Steve Canny, https://github.com/scanny
  Licensed under the MIT License

  Reference clone (read-only for this port):
    Tag:    v1.0.2
    Commit: 278b47b

The default presentation template and related binary/XML resources under
resources/templates/ are copied from python-pptx src/pptx/templates/ without
modification.

See LICENSE for the Mat2Ppt license text. Upstream python-pptx license text
is MIT and is reproduced in the python-pptx distribution.
